	(microblaze_option_override): Set it for v10.0 and later.
	(microblaze_bitfield_operands_p): New function.
	* config/microblaze/microblaze.h (microblaze_has_bitfield): Declare.
	(TARGET_HAS_BITFIELD): Define.
	* config/microblaze/microblaze.md (extzvsi, *extzvsi, insvsi)
